WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Finance Core. A real application walkthrough using synthetic data.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Net worth, income and expenses in one view. All data in this demonstration is fictitious.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Accounts grouped by institution. Net worth includes manual investments; it is not all liquid cash.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The read-only GoCardless connector requires provider configuration and consent. It is not configured here.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:39.000
The local alternative: select a synthetic CSV and review its preview before confirming.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:47.000
After confirming two rows, preview the file again: duplicate protection prevents counting them twice.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Analytics summarize income, spending and savings trends from local transactions.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:05.000
An extra-savings scenario helps explore goals. It is an estimate, not a financial promise.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Local crypto holdings: quantities and recorded cost. No market prices, P&L, connected wallets or trading.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Real application, synthetic data. No connected banks, live prices or external AI. Source code remains private.
